Progress status for this period: on_track. This was computed from strengthIndex by a fixed rule, so treat it as settled and use progressiveOverload.notes to explain it with the specific numbers. The rule: regressing if any muscle group's index dropped 3+ points, otherwise on_track if any rose 3+ points, otherwise stalling; changes are measured against previousIndex, or against 100 (the user's first recorded level) when previousIndex is null.

Analyze this data and submit a structured recommendation using the submit_training_recommendation tool. Base all quantitative judgments strictly on the numbers provided above — do not invent or assume any data not present here. Use the user's age, sex, and BMI, if provided in userContext, to calibrate what counts as reasonable training volume and intensity for their profile. Use strengthIndex as your primary evidence for progressive overload. Use volumeSplit and routineAdherence together to judge balance and consistency. Factor in the user's long-term goal and this period's note (if provided) when shaping your advice and action items. Only make physiological claims that are well established — for example, do not claim that training one muscle group raises hormone levels enough to drive muscle growth elsewhere. If totalSets is 0, note that no training was logged this period rather than speculating why.

Respond entirely in Traditional Chinese (繁體中文). All text fields including headline, summary, notes, observations, and action items must be written in Traditional Chinese. Every text field you submit must be plain prose only — no XML tags, no markdown formatting, no stray closing tags of any kind. The headline must stand completely on its own — write it as if it's the only sentence the user will ever read.

{
  "headline": "背部與腿部訓練量終於跟上，全身均衡進步，繼續保持！",
  "summary": "本週訓練成果相當亮眼！你成功聽取了上期建議，大幅改善了背部與腿部的訓練量，整體共完成28組、總重量達10,732公斤。胸部、背部和腿部各佔6組，訓練分配更趨均衡。胸部與背部的強度指數持續上升，整體進度判定為「穩定進步」。身為28歲、體重72公斤的男性，目前的訓練量對增肌目標來說相當適合，繼續維持這個勢頭！",
  "progressiveOverload": {
    "notes": "本期進步狀態判定為「穩定進步（on_track）」，主要依據如下：胸部強度指數從104上升至107（+3點），背部從103上升至105（+2點），兩者均呈正向進展。腿部指數從105微降至104（-1點），尚未達到衰退標準（需下降3點以上才算衰退），屬正常波動範圍。肩膀（102→102）、二頭肌（101→101）、三頭肌（103→103）本期指數持平，無明顯進步也無退步。整體而言，主要大肌群（胸、背）呈正向趨勢，符合增肌目標的超負荷原則。",
    "status": "on_track"
  },
  "muscleImbalances": [
    {
      "muscleGroup": "二頭肌",
      "severity": "mild",
      "observation": "本期二頭肌僅3組，佔總訓練量4%，強度指數持平（101→101），相較於三頭肌3組（8.4%重量佔比）略顯不足，可考慮適度增加彎舉訓練。"
    },
    {
      "muscleGroup": "肩膀",
      "severity": "mild",
      "observation": "肩膀僅4組，佔總訓練量10.4%，強度指數連續持平（102→102），對全面增肌而言訓練量偏少，建議適時補強。"
    }
  ],
  "deloadRecommended": false,
  "deloadReason": null,
  "actionItems": [
    "繼續維持背部每週6組的訓練量，並嘗試在划船或引體向上動作上小幅增加重量或次數，進一步推動背部強度指數突破105。",
    "腿部本期指數微降（105→104），下週腿部訓練時可專注於動作品質與漸進負荷，避免連續下滑，建議在深蹲或腿押動作上保持或超越上期的重量。",
    "二頭肌和肩膀指數連續持平，建議各增加1組針對性訓練（如啞鈴彎舉與側平舉），總組數可從3組提升至4組，刺激新的肌肉適應。",
    "下週維持全身訓練組數在28組以上，並留意每餐攝取足夠蛋白質（建議每公斤體重1.6至2公克，即每日約115至144公克），為增肌目標提供充足的營養基礎。"
  ],
  "contextSummary": "本期成功改善背部與腿部訓練量（各6組），胸部（107）與背部（105）強度指數持續上升，腿部微降至104，肩膀與手臂指數持平，整體均衡性明顯提升，下期重點為鞏固腿部進步並補強肩膀與二頭肌訓練量。"
}
